# | Carlo Gavazzi ET340 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: carlo-gavazzi-em330-em340-et330-et340-modbus.pdf (EM300/ET300 Series V2 Rev.17)
# | - 3-phase energy meter with tariff management (time-of-use). Identical register map
# | to EM340; the ET variant adds tariff control via digital input or serial communication
# | but the Modbus register addresses are the same.
# | - INT32 word order: LSW->MSW (little-endian) → word_order = "le".
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N2.
